concept:australian-capital-territory-water-management-legislation-amendment-act-2013-sec-17-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17 December"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-17-3 ;
    values:originalText "ComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00147    No. 147, 2013 Australian Capital Territory Water Management Legislation Amendment Act 2013  Commencement information Column 1 Column 2 Column 3 Provision(s) Commencement Date/Details Royal Assent, they commence on the day after the end of that period. Note 1: This table relates only to the provisions of this Act as originally enacted. It will not be amended to deal with any later amendments of this Act. Note 2: Items 1 and 3 of Schedule 2 to this Act amend provisions of the Water Act 2007 that concern the Basin Plan under that Act (see items 3 and 5 of the table). The Basin Plan was adopted on 22 November 2012.  (2) Any information in column 3 of the table is not part of this Act. Information may be inserted in this column, or information in it may be edited, in any published version of this Act." ;
    skos:definition "ComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00147    No. 147, 2013 Australian Capital Territory Water Management Legislation Amendment Act 2013  Commencement information Column 1 Column 2 Column 3 Provision(s) Commencement Date/Details Royal Assent, they commence on the day after the end of that period. Note 1: This table relates only to the provisions of this Act as originally enacted. It will not be amended to deal with any later amendments of this Act. Note 2: Items 1 and 3 of Schedule 2 to this Act amend provisions of the Water Act 2007 that concern the Basin Plan under that Act (see items 3 and 5 of the table). The Basin Plan was adopted on 22 November 2012.  (2) Any information in column 3 of the table is not part of this Act. Information may be inserted in this column, or information in it may be edited, in any published version of this Act."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9d1203cd12d8f963b24ae8a49a0686989d07eafd9fa5c0f6e4025bb249f7317d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "6"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commencement information for the Australian Capital Territory Water Management Legislation Amendment Act 2013." ;
