    skos:prefLabel "3 Schedule(s)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3-2 ;
    values:originalText "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00147  Schedule 1  Australian Capital Territory (Planning and Land Management) Act 1988  Australian Capital Territory Water Management Legislation Amendment Act 2013 No. 147, 2013" ;
