    skos:prefLabel "8 Paragraph 30(2)(a)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-8 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (a) a liability arises in respect of:  (i) land at a time when it is Territory Land; or  (ii) the management of the taking of water on National Land; or  (iii) the regulation of the taking of water on National Land; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00147  Schedule 2  Water Act 2007  Australian Capital Territory Water Management Legislation Amendment Act 2013 No. 147, 2013" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (a) a liability arises in respect of:  (i) land at a time when it is Territory Land; or  (ii) the management of the taking of water on National Land; or  (iii) the regulation of the taking of water on National Land; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00147  Schedule 2  Water Act 2007  Australian Capital Territory Water Management Legislation Amendment Act 2013 No. 147, 2013"@en ;
