concept:australian-capital-territory-water-management-legislation-amendment-act-2013-sch-2-sec-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 Subsection 22(1) (table item 2, column headed “Specific"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-1 ;
    values:originalText "requirements”) Before “The Authority must consult a State”, insert: The surface water of the Googong Dam Area (within the meaning of the Canberra Water Supply (Googong Dam) Act 1974) must be included in a water resource plan area for which the Australian Capital Territory (and not New South Wales) prepares a water resource plan (see section 63A)." ;
    skos:definition "requirements”) Before “The Authority must consult a State”, insert: The surface water of the Googong Dam Area (within the meaning of the Canberra Water Supply (Googong Dam) Act 1974) must be included in a water resource plan area for which the Australian Capital Territory (and not New South Wales) prepares a water resource plan (see section 63A)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "27aa79e8305c6997321a69acac3d3d5da87b9de29d314761b19578504106d915" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must include surface water of Googong Dam Area in a water resource plan area for the Australian Capital Territory." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
